      "duration_ms": 10000,
      "caption": "Board config declares the super size, groups and partition list.",
      "narration": "The board config declares the super size, then update groups with a size cap and a partition list. Build tools use these to run lpmake.",
      "elements": [
        {
          "id": "heading",
          "type": "title",
          "text": "BoardConfig.mk",
          "x": 8,
          "y": 5,
